  "method": "Close-to-close daily returns of the index, each session assigned the factor values at 16:00 WIB of its date (the Moon's phase sector, Mercury retrograde or direct, the pasaran, the Sun's sign). Each group is compared with all other sessions by Welch's t (two-sided p from Student's t, Welch-Satterthwaite degrees of freedom), Bonferroni over all groups. Daily returns are fat-tailed and their volatility clusters, so p-values are approximate; Sun signs track calendar months and carry month-of-year effects. Descriptive statistics, not a trading signal."
